                 skos:definition "SOC 2018 broad group 17-2010 Aerospace Engineers; it contains the single detailed occupation 17-2011 Aerospace Engineers, whose definition is: Perform engineering duties in designing, constructing, and testing aircraft, missiles, and spacecraft. May conduct basic and applied research to evaluate adaptability of materials and equipment to aircraft design and manufacture. May recommend improvements in testing equipment and techniques."@en .


